From: LM-G820N Developer <dev@lmg820n.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] debian: use build-architecture tools when cross-compiling

Run Python and Vala tools on the build architecture. Keep the sensor
libraries and the introspection cross-tool wrappers on the target
architecture.

diff --git a/debian/control b/debian/control
--- a/debian/control
+++ b/debian/control
@@ -13,10 +13,10 @@ Build-Depends:
  pkgconf,
  protobuf-c-compiler,
  protobuf-compiler,
- python3-dev,
- python3-gi <!nocheck>,
- python3-protobuf <!nocheck>,
- valac,
+ python3-dev:native,
+ python3-gi:native <!nocheck>,
+ python3-protobuf:native <!nocheck>,
+ valac:native,
 Standards-Version: 4.7.4
 Section: libs
 Vcs-Browser: https://salsa.debian.org/DebianOnMobile-team/libssc
